  <name>SenatorialNotes</name>
  <summary>Private, local-only Markdown notes</summary>
  <developer id="io.github.SenatorialNotes">
    <name>SenatorialNotes contributors</name>
  </developer>
  <description>
    <p>
      SenatorialNotes is a native Linux notes application that keeps ordinary
      Markdown files on your device. It has no accounts, cloud service,
      telemetry, analytics, advertising, or runtime networking.
    </p>
    <p>
      The current source provides local vault creation, Markdown editing,
      atomic autosave, Trash and restore, appearance preferences, formatting,
      and optional individually encrypted notes. More note-management features
      are planned before 1.0.
    </p>
  </description>
